          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "ZCh4e9eZSUf41K4cmCEL",
            "model_id": "eleven_v4",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "similarity_boost": 1.0,
            "stability": 0.5
          },
          "sequence": "001",
          "speaker": "customer"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:002",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "Las berenjenas, las judías largas y las lufas cuestan 3 yuanes por jin. El melón amargo es un poco más caro: 4 yuanes por jin.",
          "file": "elevenlabs/es-es/2026-06-29-buying-vegetables_dialogue_002_es-es.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-10-06T19:12:07+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "gD1IexrzCvsXPHUuT0s3",
            "model_id": "eleven_v4",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "similarity_boost": 1.0,
            "stability": 0.5
          },
          "sequence": "002",
          "speaker": "vendor"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:003",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "Entonces póngame un jin de cada cosa, por favor. ¿Cuánto es en total?",
          "file": "elevenlabs/es-es/2026-06-29-buying-vegetables_dialogue_003_es-es.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-10-06T19:12:10+08:00",
          "generation": {
